OL,3,GNEWSAJury in Noah Donohoe inquest
OL,4,Aretires after juror discharged earlier
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe jury in the Noah Donohoe inquest
OL,7,Fhas retired after deliberating for four
OL,8,Fhours during which a jury member was
OL,9,Fdischarged.
OL,11,FThe deliberations resumed on Monday
OL,12,Fmorning after being adjourned at the
OL,13,Fbeginning of July to facilitate summer
OL,14,Fholiday arrangements.
OL,16,FThe inquest has been examining
OL,17,F14-year-old Noah's disappearance and
OL,18,Fdeath in north Belfast in June 2020.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
