OL,3,GNEWSAJury in Noah Donohoe inquest
OL,4,Aretires after juror discharged earlier
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe jury - now seven men and two women
OL,7,F- has resumed deliberations in the case
OL,8,Fafter the summer recess. The decision
OL,9,Fto remove a juror was announced by the
OL,10,Fcoroner Mr Justice Rooney with the
OL,11,Freasons not made public.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
